                                "sense_id": "754c7e83-d644-3a73-926d-ca79c4819c1d",
                                "text": "for it wel abydeth the cold wynter tyme, and ys also muche strenthened therby, and it shalbe good with other herbes unto the sede tyme."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "87fdaa1a-cef2-4071-a22e-fe422420457e",
                                "sense_id": "754c7e83-d644-3a73-926d-ca79c4819c1d",
                                "text": "and their owne judgments and saffeties instructing them to worke hard in the faint tyme of sommer, (the better to be accomodated and fitted for the wynter,)"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "2b3e1a83-aa94-4f70-b834-fedb0d4799ea",
                                "sense_id": "754c7e83-d644-3a73-926d-ca79c4819c1d",
                                "text": "My very good L , A long and wastyng diseas in the s hath disarmed me to fight with a cold wynter."
